# Review-harness state that belongs to one machine and one operator:
# run catalogs (the critic's passes verbatim), the machine profile, the
# forwarding buffer, the compiled operator-profile cache.
docs/review/*/
.review_harness/
docs/review/operator_profile.md

# The installing agent's observations about the operator (seeds the profile
# as proposals; never enters history, may never carry secrets)
OPERATOR_OBSERVATIONS.md

